# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
mneme

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
*.out
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# env file
.env

# Local orchestrator config (personal, not shared)
CLAUDE.local.md

# Editor/IDE
# .idea/
# .vscode/

# Spec artifact tree — generated locally, published manually to wirvii/mneme-spec
tmp/

# Profile activation lock (SPEC-092) — machine-local materialization receipt,
# absolute paths + rule UUIDs, never committed. Scoped to the lock file only:
# .mneme/shared/ (team-memory vault, SPEC-053) must stay trackable, and the
# .mneme-profile pin lives at the repo root, outside .mneme/ entirely.
.mneme/profile.lock
